# 🚀 Auto Data Cleaner Pro

A production-style Data Automation SaaS built with Python and Streamlit.

This tool automatically loads data from multiple sources, performs intelligent data cleaning, detects outliers, generates EDA reports, and exports a professional PDF summary — all in one click.

---

## 🌟 Key Features

### 📂 Multi-Source Data Upload
- CSV files  
- Excel files (.xlsx)  
- Public Google Sheets link  
- SQL Database connection  

### 🧹 Automated Data Cleaning
- Duplicate removal  
- Missing value detection  
- Smart filling  
  - Median for numerical columns  
  - Mode for categorical columns  
- Automatic data type handling  

### ⚠ Outlier Detection
- IQR-based detection for numerical columns  

### 📊 Automated EDA
- Dataset overview (rows, columns, missing values)  
- Summary statistics  
- Column insights  

### 📄 Business PDF Report Export
- Cleaning report  
- Outlier summary  
- Dataset statistics  
- Downloadable PDF  

### 🎨 SaaS Dashboard Interface
- Clean layout  
- Metric cards  
- Structured output sections  
- Interactive UI  

